{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "友", "id": "友"}, {"form": "因", "id": "因"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "沓", "id": "沓"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "法", "id": "法"}, {"form": "獲", "id": "獲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.591424117963223, "source": "獲", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 1.347679524992111, "source": "獲", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "先", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "先", "target": "法"}, {"weight": 2.8292840659163265, "source": "先", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.7531446331002754, "source": "先", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.646962509122372, "source": "先", "target": "因"}, {"weight": 1.548350220454262, "source": "先", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "先", "target": "沓"}, {"weight": 1.1935288451648527, "source": "上", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 0.8368539012261204, "source": "悅", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "王", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "王", "target": "法"}, {"weight": 1.2423190093342849, "source": "王", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.136136885356381, "source": "王", "target": "因"}, {"weight": 1.730671777248217, "source": "王", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "王", "target": "沓"}, {"weight": 3.457892725338701, "source": "世", "target": "法"}, {"weight": 1.7531446331002754, "source": "世", "targe